app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  off

annotations
  A       A    annotations  off
  up k    ↑/k  up           off
  down j  ↓/j  down         off
  enter   ↵    open file    off
  o       o    browser      off

log (types)
  up k         ↑/k     up            off
  down j       ↓/j     down          off
  pgup b       b/pgup  page up       off
  pgdown f     f/pgdn  page down     off
  u ctrl+u     u       ½ page up     off
  d ctrl+d     d       ½ page down   off
  home g       g/home  top           off
  end G        G/end   bottom        off
  space enter  space   fold          off
  +            +       expand        off
  -            -       collapse      off
  *            *       fold all      off
  e            e       next error    off
  E            E       prev error    off
  w            w       next warning  off
  W            W       prev warning  off
  /            /       search        off
  enter        enter   search        on
  esc          esc     cancel        on
  n            n       next match    off
  N            N       prev match    off
  left h       ←/h     left          off
  right l      →/l     right         off
  s            s       wrap          off
  t            t       times         off
  #            #       line numbers  off
  F            F       follow        off
  esc          esc     back          off
